==English==

===Verb===
{{en-verb|fribbl}}

# To [[waste]] or [[fritter]].
# To [[behave]] in a [[frivolous]] way.
#* {{quote-book|year=1984|passage=We dried in the sun on a boulder as warm as a dying stove, and '''fribbled''' and monkeyed with each other, priming for later.|author=Guy Davenport|title=Apples and Pears}}
# To [[totter]].

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Of no or little [[importance]], [[frivolous]].

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[trifling]] action.
# A [[trifler]].
# A frivolous, contemptible fellow; a fop.
#* Thackeray
#*: A pert '''fribble''' of a peer.

